Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.08,0:00:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Darling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,on the cobalt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,blue The clouds float above the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanging out just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,me and you Our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,time is now and soon you'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile with all your heart\Nas you go past the problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that await you keep your\Nhopes alive never look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,down upon yourself just\Ncast a magic spell you will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,get through crazy crazy\Nrainbow star twinkle twinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,rainbow star fast beats\Npremonitions just like the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Colors from all the rainbow\Nbeams. Crazy crazy rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,star come with me and\Nwe'll go far we're just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,fallen angels shooting arrows\Ninto our hopeful dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,crazy crazy rainbow star\Ni'm a crazy rainbow star
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, crazy rainbow star Twinkle,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,twinkle rainbow star\NWithin the cobalt blue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven colors will come\Nto our surprise Crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,crazy rainbow star Twinkle,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,twinkle rainbow star Abandon\Nall your worries Your troubles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,show through the mirror of\Nyour eyes Let me comfort you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My love, I'll hold your time within\Nmy glove. We sure are fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Angels just singing our hearts\Nall out from up above, dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,dying Crazy, crazy hippo star\NI'm a crazy hippo star Crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,crazy hippo star I'm a crazy hippo star
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So Usopp's really gonna come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him on the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He was practicing his big return speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I was so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go get him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's Usopp for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get our crew back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you\Nwant to see him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't allow you\Nto bring him back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't kiss his ass and tell\Nhim you're happy to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Until he bows his head and apologizes\Nfor what he did, he can't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you big dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't know what\Nyour problem is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what you two were\Nthinking when you started arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't matter who was\Nwrong or who was right either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.90,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When two men agree to have\Na duel with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what the outcome\Nis, they have to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And after he lost that duel,\Nhe left by his own accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be an idiot, but this\Nguy is still our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're better off without a crew member who
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't respect their leader\Nwhen things get rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A crew with no respect\Nand a captain that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,demand it are destined\Nto fall apart quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if you're\Neasygoing most of the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but right now you've got to man up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let people walk all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you do that, it's going\Nto be me who leaves this crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making this more\Ncomplicated than it needs to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it's fine if he joins the crew again,\Nand it's fine if you want him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,if he doesn't apologize for what he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and pretends like nothing ever\Nhappened between the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,then I won't forgive him\Nand I won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we'll leave\Nthe island without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zoro, I agree that Usopp's\Nthe one at fault, not Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can settle that with him\Nafter he joins up with us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So the fact that he left\Nour crew means nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he can come and go as he pleases No but I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:05:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami I hate to admit it but just this once
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,at least I have to agree\Nwith what he's saying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If he pulls a pointless\Nstunt like this on a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,whim then how are we\Nsupposed to trust him moving
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, it's simple. If\Nthe first thing that comes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,out of Usop's mouth is an\Napology then we're good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he tries to make some\Nexcuse then he's no longer welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just pretending to\Nbe pirates. This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it lasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We already went our separate ways before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a few days until\Nthey finish with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We have found the Straw\NHat crew's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on Scrap Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're preparing to depart as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't have long, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After him, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get on the ship. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp After having such a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,heartwarming farewell With\NLuffy and his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that\Nthis is rather awkward?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell that to Sengoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me. He's the one who got all\Npass and told us we had to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cocky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have known that I can't catch\Nmy grandson wasn't a good excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut your trap, you rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you sure you want\Nto take a nap there, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to go to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pain to ride the\Nheadquarters on my bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, maybe you should go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even better, you could help us fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joining the crew again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the new ship is done by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone must be waiting\Nfor me to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't procrastinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm going to\Nhave a problem anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been training day and\Nnight, so I'm ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are friends, so just to be nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try not to make a big\Ndeal about how awesome I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Since all of you are crying and\Nbegging on your hands and knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll make an exception\Nand come back as first mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, first mate, Usopp,\Nyou're the best ever! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything you say\Nas long as you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I always knew I was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I may fall down, but I\Nalways get right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After conquering adversity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone will love the brave hero, Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,even more, and we'll all\Nlive happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've had some good times,\Nbut this is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me, Water 7!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit still!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Freaky Family will never die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When you come back, we'll be\Nright here waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it? We're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Last call, Straw Hat. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like we're still missing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've waited long enough already\Nand he never bothered to show up
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We waited for him all that time,\Nbut he never bothered to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess we have our answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he quit being a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big world out there\NBut I'm sure we'll run into
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,him again someday even if\Nhe isn't one of us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ripper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got battleship. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,hear you what's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the deal what
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,are you doing coming back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you were gonna leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I say a lot of things truth of the\Nmatter is I'm sending you to a watery grave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't much consolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For what it's worth, I'll\Nfight you all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannonball, please. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this one my...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Peter's Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He just threw that with his bare hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I flew faster than any\Ncannonball I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And he pitched it just like a baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Those used to fly a lot\Nfaster in my younger days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to get out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't, he's going to\Nwreck our brand new ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now bring me a thousand\Nmore on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's plenty\Nmore where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The meteor fist shower? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one shot and their\Nship is going up in smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I hope you're ready, boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone protect the ship\Nfrom those cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he really not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that idiot doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp came back after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp's right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, this is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing, long-nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be on that boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the heck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the Marines here, and\Nwhy is Loopy leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.66,0:11:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really out of the loop, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This has got to be a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we had our differences, but you\Ncan't really be leaving without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't they can't\Nhow can they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still friends aren't we we've\Nbeen fighting side-by-side all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I was there right\Nafter all that happened
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have worn that\Nmask to protect my pride,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was still me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs are broken\Nover there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming back to the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come, come alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone protect the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend Ousup's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So how about the weather\Nwe're having today, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go fishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,After the cannonballs are gone, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I got some great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys just turn around\Nand pick me up right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll be happy to\Nbe your vice-captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good deal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.76,0:13:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're nervous about seeing\Nme again, but we're all buddies here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm sorry I can't\Nfollow you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry I was in\Npain till the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you actually believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the stuff we've\Nbeen through together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't leave the crew over\Nsomething silly like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we had a little\Ndisagreement, but we're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And friends can put the\Npast behind them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar, he's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're serious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this. You're\Nreally gonna leave without me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how it is, then I have\Nonly one thing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever I go, it's my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too stubborn! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I take back every word I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm being pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I already said I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But will you let me take it back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you you gotta forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not with you there's no point\Ndon't leave me alone I need you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything. Please let me\Njoin the crew just one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab on already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not drop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty lame, you two. Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to get away from these stupid\Ncannonballs and head to the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Show the Navy who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cheer so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, big room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,no way what the heck do they\Nthink they're doing why are they
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Burling their sails, they're not\Ngiving up, are they? Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't know what that fool is up\Nto but my grandson's no quitter
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll tell you that hurry up i\Nsaid furl the sails yeah he said
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.94,0:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you sure about this Franky doesn't seem\Nvery smart to me Hey, stop being an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some faith in your own ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second ago, you were\Ncrying, and now you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, never mind, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you shut up and help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave until we\Ngive this ship a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our maiden voyage, so there's\Nno point if we don't do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's got\Nto have Lion in it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought of the perfect name!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Black Bear, Polar Bear, Lion, Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a horrible name for a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about the Super\NWolf, Gorilla Bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Naming off animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.23,0:18:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you pick one and work from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Squid, Octopus, Chimpanzee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I did have a lion\Nin mind for the design.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the guys at Galilad\Ndidn't seem to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That figurehead's nice, huh? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I love sunflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a sunflower, you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't take it so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't expect that everyone is\Ngoing to see it for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the ship the future\Nking of the pirates will ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you were thinking\Nwhen you built it, right, Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The oceans in the new\Nworld may have monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is the king of beasts\Nthat will reign over them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A splendid sun and dis...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the sun, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship as bright as the sun,\Nsailing with a shining smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,as it soars over the\Ndangers of a thousand seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs a name to match that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.46,0:19:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it's not\Nthe sun ice for brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be my place,\Nbut I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you call this ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Thousand Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, it's super cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking Dandelion, Lion, Dandy,\NUnbearable Bear, but this is way better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of wanted Big Boss Lionel, but\NThousand Sunny is pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.74,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to suggest\NCreature of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Monsieur Sunflower, Purcell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Have all of you lost your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship to sail a thousand\Nseas with a sunny smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just a warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a name that's\Ngonna knock your socks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship will now be known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, guys. Pop's idea just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go with that and get this ship done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousandth sunny it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought we'd have a harder time agreeing\Non this, but I guess it worked out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky, stop pouting and get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this secret weapon of yours\Nso we can get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Better make it fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's gonna catch up any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one last look at Water 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's gonna be out\Nof sight before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, once we start\Nmoving, we'll really be moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and if you're there, Colby, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The other guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot my name again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you yapping about, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I got plenty more cannonballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor... Fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going to\Nhappen, but we're going to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope to see\Nyou guys again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Loopy, that was super cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You little turd, you show your\Ngrandpa some respect, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's annoying you\Nlike that, but calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us\Nname the ship Ice Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to everybody else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Monster Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear a darn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.82,0:21:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that pirates can't even go out\Nto sea without causing a giant ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:22:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Combining the power of our air can\Nwith the durability of the Atomwood,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made an emergency\Nacceleration device.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound some manners into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's serious this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.14,0:22:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did first?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did their ship take off and fly away?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd feel\Nthis again, but here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.10,0:23:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.54,0:23:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It eats up three barrels of cola,\Nbut it can fly for a whole kilometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to brag\Nhere, but simply put,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,anything that Going Mary could\Ndo, this ship can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's got tricks of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if it's all new!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the brave spirit of the\NMary can live on in this sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything breaks, I'll\Nfix it up as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From weapons to furniture, I\Nknow this ship up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.64,0:23:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be my masterpiece,\Nbut it's all yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They got away after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my grandson for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a shame I wish the\Nlittle guy had stayed with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.78,0:24:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm gonna miss him,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but wherever he goes he still\Nwants to come to Elbeth someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll be there waiting when he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a couple hundred years left on\Nus, so we can afford to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.40,0:24:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what they need at the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got repair work to do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.12,0:24:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Better head back to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna be business as usual soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.72,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Big Bro do this stuff? Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I always just did what he told me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.94,0:24:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're going to starve to death, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling something like this\Nwould happen to you, Riff Reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.17,0:25:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come here just to make fun of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.08,0:25:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I came to offer you a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need work, then you should\Nstop by the Galley-La offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean it, Iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.34,0:25:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Iceberg? No! Bigbro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.24,0:25:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our new Bigbro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.20,0:25:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.98,0:25:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Commodore Smoker, excellent work. Huh, you\Nsaid that pirate had a 50 million bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.00,0:25:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic, the Navy standards\Nare dropping these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.98,0:25:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One disappointment after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.92,0:25:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.83,0:25:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the Straw Hats wanted posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They all have bounties Who do\Nyou think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're not Smoker, oops\NWear your glasses, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.06,0:25:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico, Robin, what in the world is\NMiss Allsunday doing on Luffy's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something mysterious about\Nthat woman, but this is quite the shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.58,0:26:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If this news reaches Princess Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.76,0:26:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine how\Ndisheartened she would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.80,0:26:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.82,0:26:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I already heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.28,0:26:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.42,0:26:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.74,0:26:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you of all\Npeople would be shocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.22,0:26:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you're as\Nclose to Luffy as I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.38,0:26:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never quite\Ntell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.16,0:26:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether I understand his reasoning or not,\NI still believe in everything he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.30,0:26:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know that he's going to\Nbe king of the pirates one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.18,0:26:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The best we can do is\Nrespect his decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.82,0:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned into such a fine\Nyoung lady, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.36,0:26:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's nothing to cry about. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The navy will always be the navy and\Nas long as we're part of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.38,0:26:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a limit to what we can\Naccomplish on our own in other words
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.36,0:26:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what we need is a higher rank after\Nthat incident at Enies Lobby pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.48,0:27:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,from all over the world will be\Nlooking up to Straw Hat and his crew
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.52,0:27:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,i see
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.68,0:27:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm putting my pride on the line here i\Nswear i will crush them in the new world
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.44,0:27:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.30,0:27:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everybody raise a glass for the\Nreturn of our old friends Robin and Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.82,0:27:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as our new crew member, Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.26,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and the best ship ever,\Nthe Thousand Money!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it for our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Next stop, Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.40,0:27:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
